insert into public.cpl_memory (slug,kind,title,summary,tags,status,source,verified_by,verified_at,author,event_date) values
('d-printed-total-test-out-step-s674','decision','A heading range whose low end is a test-out takes the printed total','S674: a printed_total reconcile step (Moreno Valley only) sets total_units to the page''s Total where the record holds exactly the heading''s range (Required Courses (16-20 Units)), the page prints (Test out option available), the total is the range''s top and every block is rule-all with stated figures summing to it. The one step that replaces a filled figure. Guitar 38758 to 20. #3444.',array['program-requirements','harvest','reconcile','rccd'],'proposed','S674 SkyRedpoll, #3444; d-mvc-38758-total-is-20-s673',null,null,'SkyRedpoll (S674)','2026-11-17'),
('d-rcc-social-justice-degree-total-stays-s674','decision','Riverside City Social Justice: the degree totals stay as filed','S674, COBIx #3438 point 3: 41749 and 43896 carry degree_total 60 from the ADT sentence; 41757 and 44363 none. At Riverside City all 37 ADTs without a degree total pass and the 4 with one fail, and 41749 and 43896 fail on the major (Required Courses prints Units: 9.00; the reading kept 3 and 6), not on the degree. Filling 60 on the passing two adds no pass and risks two. The fix for the two failing is their Required Courses structure, a harvest item.',array['program-requirements','harvest','rccd'],'proposed','S674 SkyRedpoll; records kb/program_requirements_college/riverside_city/records/{41749,43896,41757,44363}.json',null,null,'SkyRedpoll (S674)','2026-11-17'),
('f-los-rios-profile-filed-s674','fact','The Los Rios district profile is filed, with its systems unknown','S674: kb/district_profiles/los-rios.json (RCCD pilot step 5). Four colleges, each a compiled 2026-2027 PDF read from Sam''s filed copy because every Los Rios host answers the reader 404; the program mapper is mapmaker.losrios.edu. SIS, curriculum system and CPL coding are null: no page the reader can open names them. #3445.',array['district-profiles','los-rios'],'proposed','S674 SkyRedpoll, #3445; program_source_registry census 2026-11-15',null,null,'SkyRedpoll (S674)','2026-11-17')
on conflict (slug) do nothing;

